        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mnhistoricnw.org/museums/local-history-museums/goodridge-area-historical-society/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office has operated in Goodridge since 1915, keeping the town connected for over a century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goodridge%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Goodridge served as the eastern terminus of the Minnesota Northwestern Electric Railway from 1914 until 1940.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goodridge%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
